## IndexedBatchDrawV2
repr: {"align": null, "int": null, "kind": "c", "packed": null}
Versioned mixed-topology draw. The original indexed-batch ABI remains
triangle-list-only and unchanged.
struct IndexedBatchDrawV2 {
  index_count: u32,
  first_index: u32,
  base_vertex: i32,
  rgba8_srgb: u32,
  topology: u32,
  reserved: u32,
  // POINT_LIST-only integer point width in pixels. Zero selects the renderer default. This occupies the original reserved word so the V2 C ABI layout remains unchanged; all other topologies require zero.
}
