## IndexedDrawBatch
repr: {"align": null, "int": null, "kind": "c", "packed": null}
Bounded render-pass batch used by custom WGPU backends. All ranges share
one surface, pipeline and vertex/index binding, matching ordinary repeated
`draw_indexed` calls inside one WebGPU render pass.
struct IndexedDrawBatch {
  surface: u64,
  pipeline: u64,
  vertex_buffer: u64,
  index_buffer: u64,
  vertex_offset: u64,
  index_offset: u64,
  clear_rgba8_srgb: u32,
  draw_count: u32,
  draws: [IndexedBatchDraw; 16],
}
