## RetainedFrameSubmitV3
repr: {"align": null, "int": null, "kind": "c", "packed": null}
Scene with up to 8192 buffer-backed TRS seeds and four index ranges.
Supports PBR, or the dedicated cube-patch v2 contract with default material
parameters and exactly one full 44-index range.
Inline frame seeds/count must be zero. The seed buffer contains tightly
packed 64-byte RetainedTransformSeed rows and requires MAP_READ usage.
Each seed's draw_group selects a range; flags[31:16] selects its contiguous
group-local slot. Remaining range entries and reserved must be zero.
Floats must be finite, scale/radius nonnegative, and the quaternion must
have finite squared length greater than 1e-12 (the GPU normalizes it).
struct RetainedFrameSubmitV3 {
  frame: RetainedFrameSubmitV2,
  seed_buffer: u64,
  seed_offset: u64,
  seed_count: u32,
  draw_count: u32,
  draws: [RetainedDrawRange; 4],
  reserved: [u32; 2],
}
Declaration: crates/trueos-v/src/vgpu.rs:604

